---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Refund & Shipping Policy | Somashiva™">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 py-16">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <span class="inline-block py-1.5 px-5 rounded-full bg-amber-50 border border-[#E6CA65] text-[#B8860B] text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase mb-4 shadow-sm">Customer Care</span>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold font-['Cormorant_Garamond',serif] text-[#7A5212] mt-2 mb-4 tracking-tight">Refund & Shipping Policy</h1>
      <p class="text-[#4A3B2C] text-sm font-light">Last updated: November 5, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bg-white border border-[#E6CA65]/60 rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-sm space-y-8 text-[#4A3B2C] leading-relaxed">
      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold font-['Cormorant_Garamond',serif] text-[#996515]">1. Dispatch & Shipping Timelines</h2>
        <p class="text-sm font-light">
          All orders placed directly through Somashiva™ are carefully hand-cleansed, energetically charged, and securely dispatched within <strong class="text-[#7A5212] font-semibold">3 to 5 business days</strong>. Standard delivery across India typically takes an additional 3-7 business days depending on your location. Free shipping is provided on all direct orders above ₹500.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold font-['Cormorant_Garamond',serif] text-[#996515]">2. 7-Day Return Policy</h2>
        <p class="text-sm font-light">
          We want you to feel complete energetic resonance with your sacred crystals. If you are not entirely satisfied with your direct purchase, you may request a return within <strong class="text-[#7A5212] font-semibold">7 days</strong> of delivery. Items must be unused, in their original packaging, and accompanied by proof of purchase.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold font-['Cormorant_Garamond',serif] text-[#996515]">3. Damage & Breakage Replacements</h2>
        <p class="text-sm font-light">
          Because natural crystals are delicate, we take utmost care in packaging. In the rare event that your item arrives damaged or broken during transit, please notify us within 48 hours of delivery with unboxing photos/video at <a href="mailto:somashivaofficial@gmail.com" class="text-[#996515] underline font-medium">somashivaofficial@gmail.com</a> or via WhatsApp at <strong class="text-[#7A5212]">+91 9180603108</strong>. We will promptly ship a brand new replacement at no extra charge.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="space-y-3">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold font-['Cormorant_Garamond',serif] text-[#996515]">4. Merchant Details</h2>
        <p class="text-sm font-light">
          <strong class="text-[#7A5212] block mb-1">Somashiva</strong>
          Electronic City, Bangalore, Karnataka - 560100, India<br />
          Email: somashivaofficial@gmail.com | Phone: +91 9180603108
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
